# The optional Polars lake-loader engine's libraries (docs/architecture/POLARS_LOADER_DESIGN.md section 6.2): the whole environment it
# adds to the console's, transitive packages included, one version each, proven together on Python 3.13 (the probe of section 9). The
# lock beside it, polars.lock, is written by tools/python_lock.py with the hashes; the console's own requirements are not in it
# (drishti-console/requirements-polars.txt names the same pins for pip). Python 3.12 or later: arro3-core needs typing-extensions below it.
